{"id": "architecture.06.selection-order", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-style-selection.md", "anchor": "5. 四种风格的选择顺序", "title": "按成本从低到高评估风格，能满足需求就停", "tags": ["architecture", "style-selection", "decision"], "summary": "按无显式架构、简单分层、六边形或整洁、加 DDD 的顺序评估，禁止从最复杂的往下减或跳过评估直接选最完整风格。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "source": ["reference/architecture-styles-comparison.md#1. 四种风格解决的问题"], "applies_to": ["软件架构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "architecture.06.style-mixing", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-style-selection.md", "anchor": "6. 风格混用的边界", "title": "不同子域可用不同风格，同一构建单元内只用一种", "tags": ["architecture", "style-selection", "composition"], "summary": "不同子域可按重要性使用不同风格，但同一构建单元内只用一种；混用须在架构决策记录中标明边界。", "enforcement": "advisory", "status": "active", "source": ["reference/architecture-styles-comparison.md#4. 组合形态"], "applies_to": ["软件架构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "architecture.06.style-evolution-exit", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/06-style-selection.md", "anchor": "7. 风格的演进与退出", "title": "定期复核收益是否兑现，未兑现应主动移除", "tags": ["architecture", "style-selection", "evolution"], "summary": "风格可增量引入，须定期复核引入时的假设是否成立；已付出的成本不构成继续支付的理由，移除须记录假设落空情况。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "source": ["reference/architecture-styles-comparison.md#6. 决策记录该写什么"], "applies_to": ["软件架构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "architecture.07.cqrs-levels", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/07-cqrs-and-slices.md", "anchor": "1. CQRS 的三个层级", "title": "CQRS 分契约、模型、存储三级，讨论须先明确级别", "tags": ["architecture", "cqrs", "read-write"], "summary": "契约分离成本极低、模型分离中等、存储分离引入最终一致性；禁止无实测依据为性能引入存储分离，禁止把请求响应类分离称为已实施 CQRS。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["软件架构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "architecture.07.read-write-separation", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/07-cqrs-and-slices.md", "anchor": "2. 读写模型分离的判据", "title": "读侧模型独立于写侧且不带业务行为", "tags": ["architecture", "cqrs", "read-model"], "summary": "读侧需要跨聚合视图、读写负载量级差异大或写侧规则复杂时分离模型；读侧可直接访问存储跳过领域层，禁止读侧模型带业务行为。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "source": ["reference/dotnet-architecture-decisions.md#3. Repository 在 EF Core 之上是否仍必要"], "applies_to": ["软件架构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "architecture.07.mediator-dispatch", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/07-cqrs-and-slices.md", "anchor": "3. 中介者与命令分发", "title": "分发机制的价值在横切接入，不在解耦", "tags": ["architecture", "cqrs", "mediator"], "summary": "引入分发器须能说出它解决什么问题，通常是横切关注点的统一接入；禁止以解耦为唯一理由，禁止强制所有内部调用经由分发器。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "source": ["reference/dotnet-architecture-decisions.md#2. MediatR 类中介者库的收益与代价"], "applies_to": ["软件架构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
{"id": "architecture.07.slice-vs-layer", "kind": "rule", "level": "MUST", "file": "rules/07-cqrs-and-slices.md", "anchor": "4. 垂直切片 vs 技术分层", "title": "按功能切片或按技术层组织，同一构建单元内不混用", "tags": ["architecture", "vertical-slice", "organization"], "summary": "功能多且共性低时按功能切片，层次逻辑复杂且跨功能复用多时按技术层；切片不取消依赖方向约束，禁止同一构建单元内混用两种组织方式。", "enforcement": "review", "status": "active", "applies_to": ["软件架构", "语言无关"], "reviewed_at": "2026-08-29", "owner": "desktop client team"}
